 <h3><u>Qafla hussain ka</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p></p>
  <p>Qafla hussain ka<br> Ek shab hazrat-e-shireen ne khwab kya dekha,<br> sarhaane eik zaeefa ye kar rahi hai bukaa,<br> mere hussain ne kal tujse kiya tha wada,<br> mei tere ghar kabhi aawunga, aagaya, uth jaa.</p> 
  <p>Jaag shireen, jaag ja, ay kaniz-e-bawafa,<br> aa raha hai ghar tere (Qafla hussain ka) x4</p> 
  <p>1. Haay, mere bache ko sitamgharo ne tarpaya hai,<br> dasht mei ghair liya paani ko tarsaya hai,<br> haaye is zulmo masaaib mei use yaad raha,<br> apna wada wo nibhane ke liye aya hai</p> 
  <p>Jaag shireen, jaag ja, ay kaniz-e-bawafa,<br> aa raha hai ghar tere (Qafla hussain ka) x4</p> 
  <p>2. Haay, kya khabar tujko mere gar ko ujada haay haay,<br> kistarha se mere shabbir ko mara haay haay,<br> neza akbar ke kaleje mei utara haay haay,<br> phir bhi bhulaa na tere wade ko pyaasa haay haay</p> 
  <p>Jaag shireen, jaag ja, ay kaniz-e-bawafa,<br> aa raha hai ghar tere (Qafla hussain ka) x4</p> 
  <p>3. Haay, pani lene ko gaya nehr pe Abbas mera,<br> chid gayi mashk kate haath alam thanda huwa,<br> mere bache ki kamar toot gayi phirbhi use,n<br> aam Allah ka aur wada har ek yaad raha</p> 
  <p>Jaag shireen, jaag ja, ay kaniz-e-bawafa,<br> aa raha hai ghar tere (Qafla hussain ka) x4</p> 
  <p>4. Haay, Mere besheer ko pani ke ye baz teer mila,<br> uske bachpan ko jawaani ke ye baz teer mila,<br> har sitam sehke tere ghar ki taraf aata hai,<br> jisko ummat se nishani ki ye baz teer mila</p> 
  <p>Jaag shireen, jaag ja, ay kaniz-e-bawafa,<br> aa raha hai ghar tere (Qafla hussain ka) x4</p> 
  <p>5. Haay, zakhm itne hai kaleje ka bura haal huwa,<br> dasht mei ibn-e-hassan ghoro se pamal huwa,<br> khun se dasht-e-bala laal huwa aur darya,<br> ye sitam sehke mera laal tere ghar ko chala</p> 
  <p>Jaag shireen, jaag ja, ay kaniz-e-bawafa,<br> aa raha hai ghar tere (Qafla hussain ka) x4</p> 
  <p>6. Haay, do pisar zainab-e-dilgeer ke kurban huwe,<br> haye bin pani ke wo phul bhi bejaan huwe,<br> sare Paiman wafaa pure huwe maktal mei,<br> ab tere aka tere shehr mei mehmaan huwe</p> 
  <p>Jaag shireen, jaag ja, ay kaniz-e-bawafa,<br> aa raha hai ghar tere (Qafla hussain ka) x4</p> 
  <p>7. Haay, gyaarwi subho haram chor chale dasht-e-kitaal,<br> reyt lasho ka kafan chehr ka parda huwe baal,<br> sar shaheedo ke sar-e-noke sina qayd haram,<br> is gharibi mei raha unko magar tera khayaal</p> 
  <p>Jaag shireen, jaag ja, ay kaniz-e-bawafa,<br> aa raha hai ghar tere (Qafla hussain ka) x4</p> 
  <p>8. Haay, ho gayi poori tere dil ki duwa jaag zara,<br> hai yahi teri wafaao ka sila jaag zara,<br> ghar ka har gosha aza khaana banade uthkar,<br> tera aka tera mehman huwa jaag zara</p> 
  <p>Jaag shireen, jaag ja, ay kaniz-e-bawafa,<br> aa raha hai ghar tere (Qafla hussain ka) x4</p> 
